# game/ep2.rpy:935
translate chinese freyapause_9320d26a:

    # yt "Her mother?!! What did her mother have to do with her bullying me back then?!"
    yt "她妈妈？！！她妈妈跟她以前霸凌我有什么关系？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:938
translate chinese freyapause_f3e58684:

    # a "Even if you tell me that, it still won't change the fact that I bullied somebody back then. I'm still responsible for my own actions."
    a "话是这么说，但过去霸凌别人的那个人还是我。我得为我自己的行为负责。"

# game/ep2.rpy:939
translate chinese freyapause_732a8756:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep2.rpy:940
translate chinese freyapause_31f21ac7:

    # a "I wonder where he is now? I don't even remember his name. I'm really an idiot!"
    a "不知道他现在会在哪呢？我连他的名字都记不得了。我真是差劲！"

# game/ep2.rpy:941
translate chinese freyapause_b6bf126c:

    # a "I know it's not enough, but I still want to apologize for the things that I did to him. I'm ready to face all the consequences just to fix everything with him..."
    a "虽然道歉远远不够，但我还是想当面向他表示歉意。只要能让他好受点，我可以承担一切后果……"

# game/ep2.rpy:942
translate chinese freyapause_7aa9718a:

    # a "I... I want to tell him everything..."
    a "我……我想把一切都告诉他……"

# game/ep2.rpy:943
translate chinese freyapause_e55b9a70_1:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/ep2.rpy:946
translate chinese freyapause_6b92c06c:

    # yt "Ugh! Fuck this! Let's just meet her once again and end all this stupid nonsense!"
    yt "操！不管了！我直接跟她当面对质好了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:950
translate chinese freyapause_15f52065_1:

    # "*door opens*"
    "*开门声"

# game/ep2.rpy:951
translate chinese freyapause_3a75df16:

    # mc "Then, tell me... Aine."
    mc "那，你就告诉我吧……艾妮。"

# game/ep2.rpy:952
translate chinese freyapause_55630b1f:

    # mc "...Tell me why did you make my high school a hell on earth."
    mc "……告诉我为什么你让我的高中生活每天都生不如死。"

# game/ep2.rpy:955
translate chinese freyapause_9e93a098:

    # mc "You said you wanted to tell me everything, right?"
    mc "你刚刚不还说要告诉我一切吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:956
translate chinese freyapause_6c3de6f4:

    # mc "So here I am..."
    mc "我洗耳恭听……"

# game/ep2.rpy:959
translate chinese freyapause_d4e88c37:

    # f "Uhm...... I think I should leave you guys for now."
    f "呃……那我……就不打扰你们两个了……？"

# game/ep2.rpy:967
translate chinese freyapause_d76cbc12:

    # a "W-what do you mean, [mc!t]? I... don't understand..."
    a "你——你在说什么，[mc!t]？我……我听不懂……"

# game/ep2.rpy:970
translate chinese freyapause_6633710a:

    # mc "Oh... You already forgot about me, right?"
    mc "哈哈……你还真是把我忘得一干二净啊，是吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:971
translate chinese freyapause_a8d5fb29:

    # mc "Well, let me introduce myself properly this time."
    mc "行吧，那我就给你做个正式的自我介绍吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:974
translate chinese freyapause_beefc111:

    # mc "My name is [mc!t]. You gave me the nickname 'Piggy' and I'm the one you bullied back in highschool. Nice to meet you again, Aine."
    mc "我的名字叫[mc!t]。你给我起了个外号叫“猪头”，我就是那个你在高中每天欺负的人。很高兴我们又见面了，艾妮。"

# game/ep2.rpy:980
translate chinese freyapause_ea62e648:

    # a "Mm! *sniffs*"
    a "噢…… *抽鼻子*"

# game/ep2.rpy:981
translate chinese freyapause_fb32a027:

    # mc "Oh, jesus! Why do you always-"
    mc "上帝啊，你怎么动不动就——"

# game/ep2.rpy:984
translate chinese freyapause_2441632c:

    # a "*hugs*" with hpunch
    a "*拥抱*" with hpunch

# game/ep2.rpy:985
translate chinese freyapause_1c5f9c04:

    # a "I know that you want to push me away right now."
    a "我知道你现在想把我推开。"

# game/ep2.rpy:986
translate chinese freyapause_ea4bb044:

    # a "But... P-please... just let me do this for a while..."
    a "但是……我求求你……就让我这样抱着你吧……"

# game/ep2.rpy:989
translate chinese freyapause_821f63e0:

    # yt "I don't get her. A hug is not what I expected from her after all this time."
    yt "我不懂。我没想到她会来抱我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:990
translate chinese freyapause_df6ce553:

    # a "I know crying is pointless, so I will hold back my emotion. And my apology means nothing after what I did to you. But still..."
    a "我知道哭是没有用的，所以我会控制住我的情绪。我做了那么多事，道歉肯定也没有意义了。但是……"

# game/ep2.rpy:991
translate chinese freyapause_a141b438:

    # a "With all my heart, I am sorry, [mc!t]... I'm really sorry for giving you a hard time before."
    a "我从心底里，由衷地对你感到抱歉，[mc!t]……我真的非常后悔以前那样对你。"

# game/ep2.rpy:992
translate chinese freyapause_6756ef4f:

    # a "I'm ready for whatever judgment and consequences you have for me. But at least... Let's just stay like this for a while."
    a "我愿意接受你对我的一切批评，愿意承担一切后果。但至少现在……我希望我可以这样紧紧抱着你。"

# game/ep2.rpy:995
translate chinese freyapause_9d548e34:

    # mc "No, I won't punish your or anything like that, Aine. I'm not that kind of guy. I already moved on from the past."
    mc "我不会惩罚或者报复你的，艾妮。我不是那种人。我已经放下过去了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:996
translate chinese freyapause_a5e23f3b:

    # mc "All I need is at least an explanation of it all."
    mc "我现在只想听你把一切解释清楚。"

# game/ep2.rpy:999
translate chinese freyapause_4dba9b84:

    # a "I know... And I will give it to you."
    a "我知道……我会跟你说的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1000
translate chinese freyapause_85de62b3:

    # a "But... w-would you please pat my head one more time? I want to confirm something."
    a "但是……能……能请你再摸摸我的头吗？我想确认一件事。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1001
translate chinese freyapause_0097ce09:

    # yt "What should I do?"
    yt "我该怎么做？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1004
translate chinese freyapause_8323d70e:

    # mc "No, I won't. I need you to explain everything to me now."
    mc "我拒绝。我要你现在就向我解释清楚。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1005
translate chinese freyapause_edaf1ede:

    # a "Oh... Uhm... Okay..."
    a "哦……呃……好吧……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1009
translate chinese freyapause_8f125d37:

    # a "Mnnhh..."
    a "嗯嗯……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1010
translate chinese freyapause_44f1d3f7:

    # a "{i}His hand... really feels so comfortable...{/i}"
    a "{i}他的手……真的有一种很舒服的感觉……{/i}"

# game/ep2.rpy:1013
translate chinese freyapause_562d34fd:

    # a "I was really wondering why your hand makes me feel comfortable every time you pat my head."
    a "我一直都在想，为什么你摸我的头的时候，我总会感觉很安心。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1014
translate chinese freyapause_a7e7a4fc:

    # a "So it was you all along. The one patting my head when I was asleep back then."
    a "原来一直都是你。是你之前在我睡觉的时候摸我的头。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1015
translate chinese freyapause_954212de:

    # mc "*sighs* Yes, pretty much every time I saw you having a nightmare."
    mc "*叹气* 是的，基本每次看到你做噩梦我都会那样。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1016
translate chinese freyapause_005e3aca:

    # a "I see... But why? Why did you still do that for me despite me bullying you?"
    a "原来如此……可是为什么？我一直在霸凌你，为什么你还要关心我？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1017
translate chinese freyapause_6586ef97:

    # mc "I don't know, Aine. My brain told me not to do it, but my heart told me to go ahead."
    mc "我不知道，艾妮。我的大脑告诉我不要那么做，但心里的想法却是我必须那么做。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1018
translate chinese freyapause_8865e01b:

    # mc "You gave me a hard time, humiliated me publicly, and ordered me around all the time. But, I was an idiot for not fighting back, and letting my feelings for you overtake my anger."
    mc "你一直欺负我，在大家面前公开羞辱我，还命令我给你干这干那的。但是，我那时候太傻了，才没有反击，还让我对你的感情压过了我对你的愤怒。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1019
translate chinese freyapause_602ff5eb:

    # mc "I was so stupid and naive back then."
    mc "我那时候太傻，太天真了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1020
translate chinese freyapause_ec40e92d:

    # mc "I know I should've tormented you for what you did. I even changed myself physically for that reason."
    mc "我本来觉得我一定也要让你受折磨。我甚至还为此去健身，去学搏击。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1021
translate chinese freyapause_52406236:

    # mc "But, as I got older and became more mature, I realized that any time I spent getting back at you would just be a waste of my time..."
    mc "但是，我慢慢长大，变得成熟，然后我想通了。去花时间报复你只是浪费我自己的时间而已。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1022
translate chinese freyapause_da113a91:

    # mc "...and so I focused on my own life instead. I already moved on from everything, Aine... That includes my feelings for you back then."
    mc "……所以我就打算要过好每一天了。我已经放下了过去的一切，艾妮……也包括那时候我对你的感情。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1023
translate chinese freyapause_3857e17d:

    # a "{i}He... really is a good guy... but, I didn't have any choice but to follow my mother's orders.{/i}"
    a "{i}他……真是个好人……可是，我那时别无选择，只能听从我妈妈的命令。{/i}"

# game/ep2.rpy:1024
translate chinese freyapause_7575a2cf:

    # a "I'm... really sorry, [mc!t]."
    a "我真的……很对不起你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1025
translate chinese freyapause_424fe139:

    # mc "Instead of apologizing, why don't you start telling me everything?"
    mc "别再道歉了，你把一切跟我说清楚就好了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1026
translate chinese freyapause_71955456:

    # a "Okay..."
    a "好的……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1040
translate chinese freyapause_fc756b13:

    # a "*sighs* Where do I even start?"
    a "*叹气* 我该从哪开始呢？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1041
translate chinese freyapause_7596b0d1:

    # mc "Start with the reason why you were doing those things to me back then."
    mc "就从你霸凌我的原因开始。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1042
translate chinese freyapause_015a3c05:

    # a "Alright, I'll get straight to the point. There's no reason to lie and hide it now..."
    a "好吧，那我就从那里开始讲吧。我现在也没有理由骗你或者瞒着你……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1043
translate chinese freyapause_d98a1a35:

    # mc "I'm listening."
    mc "我在听呢。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1044
translate chinese freyapause_1bcce4be:

    # a "...Mom ordered me to do it to you."
    a "……是我妈命令我那么对你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1045
translate chinese freyapause_8eefaabe:

    # yt "I already guessed as much after hearing what she said earlier. But the question is... why me? What does it have to do with me?"
    yt "我从之前偷听到的对话里已经猜到了。但问题是……为什么偏偏是我？跟我有什么关系？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1046
translate chinese freyapause_2c31e507:

    # a "I was young and powerless against her, I couldn't do anything but follow her orders, because if I didn't, she'd mistreat and hurt me until I said yes."
    a "我那时候太小了，没有能力反抗她，只能任由她摆布。如果我不同意，她就会虐待我、打我，直到我愿意为止。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1047
translate chinese freyapause_77002862:

    # a "It didn't have anything to do with you confessing to me before. Even if you hadn't, she still would have pushed me to do those things to you."
    a "而且也完全不是因为你向我表白。即使你没有，她也会逼着我欺负你。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1048
translate chinese freyapause_cad48412:

    # mc "My god! Just what kind of family do you have, Aine?! But I can't understand..."
    mc "我的天啊！你的家里人都是些什么神经病啊，艾妮！？我根本理解不了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1049
translate chinese freyapause_7117e4c0:

    # mc "Why me? What does it have to do with me?"
    mc "为什么是我？到底跟我有什么关系？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1050
translate chinese freyapause_d078ac9c:

    # a "She didn't tell me why. Every time I tried to refuse her, she'd threaten to hurt me and take Emma away from me."
    a "她没告诉我为什么。每次我想跟她说不，她都威胁说要打我，还说要让我跟艾玛永远分开。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1051
translate chinese freyapause_4a6d29d9:

    # a "She could hurt me all she wanted, but I couldn't let her take away Emma. She's my best friend, we grew up together..."
    a "她想怎么打我都可以，但我不能让她伤害艾玛。她是我最好的朋友，我们从小一起长大……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1052
translate chinese freyapause_977d1888:

    # a "I... I didn't have any choice..."
    a "我……我真的什么都做不了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1053
translate chinese freyapause_df61def0:

    # a "But even though I was forced, I know that what I did was still wrong. And there's nothing that I can do to absolve myself and reverse all the bad things that I did to you."
    a "但即使我是被强迫的，我也知道我做的事是错的。我不管做什么都没法弥补，没法补救我对你造成的伤害。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1054
translate chinese freyapause_28b70bd9:

    # a "So, I won't ask for your forgiveness. It's too selfish of me to ask, but all I want is your understanding."
    a "所以我不会请求你的原谅。那样就太自私了。我只想让你理解我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1055
translate chinese freyapause_495ebbe5:

    # mc "As I said, the past doesn't matter to me anymore, Aine. All I want is to clear things up."
    mc "我刚刚也说了，我已经不在乎过去了。我现在只想把事情搞清楚。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1056
translate chinese freyapause_ae4e60f3:

    # mc "I understand that you were forced by your stupid fucking mother."
    mc "我现在知道你都是被你那该死的傻逼老妈逼的了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1059
translate chinese freyapause_c0f21a65:

    # a "Language, [mc!t]."
    a "别说脏话呀，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1060
translate chinese freyapause_c67ab737:

    # mc "Oops... sorry..."
    mc "哎呀……不好意思……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1069
translate chinese freyapause_243baa68:

    # mc "However, I won't be able to understand everything while we don't know the reason your mom did that to you."
    mc "但是，要是不知道你妈妈这么做的动机，我还是理解不了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1070
translate chinese freyapause_6bef9968:

    # a "I really don't know, [mc!t]. She doesn't tell me anything, except giving me orders."
    a "我真的不知道，[mc!t]。她除了命令我以外，什么都不告诉我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1071
translate chinese freyapause_91569e1b:

    # a "'You do this and do that' and threatens me if I try to refuse her."
    a "她整天就只会跟我说，“去干这个”，“去干那个”，然后我要是拒绝，她就威胁我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1072
translate chinese freyapause_a2200d58:

    # yt "But, why didn't Emma tell me all this? All she told me is that Aine doesn't have a say in her own future."
    yt "可是，艾玛为什么不跟我说这些？她只告诉我艾妮没法决定她自己的未来。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1073
translate chinese freyapause_5110095d:

    # yt "Not just Emma, but Aine is being controlled by them too! Just what kind of family is that?!"
    yt "不只是艾玛，连艾妮也完全被他们控制着！这到底是个什么家庭啊？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1074
translate chinese freyapause_7942244d:

    # yt "My blood is fucking boiling right now! Not only because of what they've done to Aine and Emma, but they're supposed to treat each other well! That's what family is supposed to be!"
    yt "我浑身的血液都气得要沸腾了！一家人本来要互相照顾，和睦共处，但是他们竟然这样对艾妮和艾玛！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1075
translate chinese freyapause_3f3a4fb6:

    # yt "I have to do something to uncover all this. I have a feeling that this isn't just between me and Aine."
    yt "我得做点什么来找出所有的真相。我有预感，这绝对不是只跟我和艾妮有关的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1076
translate chinese freyapause_1c850303:

    # yt "I want to hear everything from her mother herself. But... how the heck am I going to do that?!"
    yt "我想听她的妈妈亲口跟我讲。但是……那怎么可能？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1077
translate chinese freyapause_e55b9a70_2:

    # yt "......"
    yt "......"

# game/ep2.rpy:1078
translate chinese freyapause_0dcea67e:

    # yt "Wait a minute..."
    yt "等等……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1079
translate chinese freyapause_fceca4f8:

    # yt "Didn't Freya tell me that she knows Miss Jess?"
    yt "芙蕾雅不是说她认识婕斯小姐吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1080
translate chinese freyapause_3d484ee3:

    # yt "Hm..."
    yt "嗯……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1081
translate chinese freyapause_d02bbba1:

    # yt "Maybe Miss Jess would be able to help me. She might know the family too... But I can't be sure just yet. Maybe I can try and contact her later."
    yt "或许婕斯小姐能帮我。她可能也认识这个家族里的其他人……但我还不能确定。之后我可以问问她。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1082
translate chinese freyapause_a45db02c:

    # yt "So much for leads and clues, huh? And now, it led me to another mystery..."
    yt "这件事就先想到这里吧。还有别的谜团……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1083
translate chinese freyapause_65107f8c:

    # mc "But, how did you manage to move out of your house if that's the case?"
    mc "既然这样的话，你是怎么从家里跑出来的？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1092
translate chinese freyapause_b987f3c2:

    # a "My family has a strong work ethic, especially my mother. So me, her daughter, having that kind of mindset worked in my favor."
    a "我的家庭崇尚努力工作，特别是我妈妈。所以我就利用了这种传统。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1093
translate chinese freyapause_6f9a74ac:

    # a "It was easy to convince her by telling her I was looking for a proper job."
    a "我跟她说我想出去找一份正式的工作，没费什么劲就让她同意了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1094
translate chinese freyapause_ad626d9f:

    # a "I was so happy thinking that I would finally have my freedom, but I was wrong. Even though I'm outside, I still don't have much freedom."
    a "我本来以为这样就解放了，但我大错特错了。即使离开了家，我依然没有自由可言。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1095
translate chinese freyapause_c2e470e3:

    # a "Now, she even set me up to marry her business partner!"
    a "现在，她甚至还准备让我嫁给她的生意伙伴！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1096
translate chinese freyapause_809ad50b:

    # mc "Yes, I already know that."
    mc "这我已经知道了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1097
translate chinese freyapause_1a1df8cf:

    # a "Wait... did you hear our conversation earlier?"
    a "什么……你听到我们刚刚说的话了吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1098
translate chinese freyapause_e4c41d6d:

    # mc "Yeah, I heard everything."
    mc "是的，我全都听见了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1099
translate chinese freyapause_b502d20a:

    # a "It's not good to eavesdrop on someone's conversation, you know?"
    a "偷听可不是好习惯，你知道吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1100
translate chinese freyapause_3f478685:

    # mc "I know. But what choice did I have? I wanted to know everything."
    mc "我知道。但我也没其他办法吧？我想知道真相。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1101
translate chinese freyapause_732a8756_1:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep2.rpy:1102
translate chinese freyapause_a1c16b55:

    # a "You could've turned us away the moment we arrived here, but you didn't."
    a "我们刚搬来的时候，你可以把我们赶走的，但是你没有。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1103
translate chinese freyapause_8ed3c58a:

    # a "You had the chance to take revenge for everything that we did, but you moved on from it instead."
    a "你可以报复我们，但是你选择了放下。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1104
translate chinese freyapause_a3df292f:

    # a "You're a really good guy..."
    a "你真的是个非常善良的人……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1105
translate chinese freyapause_f69da4d0:

    # a "..and I feel like a shameless little bitch facing you right now because of what I did..."
    a "……在你面前，我感觉我自己就像一个无耻的贱婊子一样。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1106
translate chinese freyapause_a46a924b:

    # mc "Hey, didn't you tell me to watch my language?"
    mc "嘿，你刚刚还让我别说脏话呢！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1107
translate chinese freyapause_91ce052e:

    # a "I'm sorry, but I have been holding back my feelings. I want to cry my heart out, I want to scream out all the pent-up feelings inside me. But... I can't."
    a "对不起，只是我一直在压抑我自己的情绪。我想大哭一场，我想大喊大叫，把我脑子里的东西全都释放出来……但是，我不能……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1110
translate chinese freyapause_c7200864:

    # a "Pain, regret, sorrow, guilt. I want them all out... I want to breathe freely away from all of it..."
    a "痛苦，后悔，悲伤，内疚……我想把这些感情全都哭出来……我想不被它们折磨，自由地呼吸……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1111
translate chinese freyapause_803e801f:

    # a "But I don't know what to do..."
    a "但我不知道我该怎么办……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1112
translate chinese freyapause_cb5b0c3f:

    # mc "*sighs* Come here."
    mc "*叹气* 来我这吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1115
translate chinese freyapause_8f0ff87a:

    # yt "Well... Fuck this! As usual, I'm doing what my heart dictates."
    yt "操……操啊！我又不由自主地安慰她了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1116
translate chinese freyapause_399d94be:

    # mc "It's alright to cry. At least... that's what you can do right now. Don't worry about anything for now, and just cry it out."
    mc "都哭出来吧，没事的。至少……那是你现在能做到的一切了。不用在意其他的事了，都哭出来就好了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1119
translate chinese freyapause_267d9f5b:

    # a "Mnnh..."
    a "嗯……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1120
translate chinese freyapause_732a8756_2:

    # a "......"
    a "......"

# game/ep2.rpy:1123
translate chinese freyapause_6f72e659:

    # a "*sniffs*"
    a "*抽鼻子*"

# game/ep2.rpy:1124
translate chinese freyapause_67010bbf:

    # a "*sobs*"
    a "*抽泣*"

# game/ep2.rpy:1125
translate chinese freyapause_1c34cba0:

    # a "Mm...!"
    a "呜呜呜……！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1126
translate chinese freyapause_4ce49b2d:

    # a "*crying* Mhhmmn..."
    a "*大哭* 呜呜呜呜呜……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1127
translate chinese freyapause_2b9b6817:

    # a "*hiccups* Mhhmmn...!"
    a "*呜咽* 呜呜呜呜呜呜呜……！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1133
translate chinese freyapause_8e394ea4:

    # "A few moments later..."
    "一段时间后……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1141
translate chinese freyapause_4cc4a164:

    # yt "*sighs* She fell asleep..."
    yt "*叹气* 她睡着了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1144
translate chinese freyapause_2285a4e3:

    # yt "I should probably move her to-"
    yt "我还是把她搬到——"

# game/ep2.rpy:1147
translate chinese freyapause_f2343764:

    # a "Mmmn!"
    a "不……要……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1152
translate chinese freyapause_3025a19e:

    # yt "Jeez..."
    yt "我去……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1153
translate chinese freyapause_ccb6a557:

    # yt "...I even forgot to ask some of the questions I have for her... But, that can wait. I can just ask her later."
    yt "……我甚至都忘了把我想的问题问完……但是，倒也不急。之后再问就是了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1154
translate chinese freyapause_08e18b9c:

    # yt "I now have one bigger question that needs an answer."
    yt "现在我有了更大的问题需要解答。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1157
translate chinese freyapause_94496d20:

    # f "She looks really comfortable. *giggles*"
    f "她看起来很安心。 *笑*"

# game/ep2.rpy:1160
translate chinese freyapause_9427cf91:

    # mc "Oh... Hey, Freya. Where did you go?"
    mc "哦……你好，芙蕾雅。你刚刚去哪了？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1161
translate chinese freyapause_b9d5dd8c:

    # f "I was talking to Sky in her room."
    f "我去跟斯凯聊天了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1162
translate chinese freyapause_054c5ee0:

    # mc "I see."
    mc "好吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1167
translate chinese freyapause_e06a65b2:

    # f "So, are you two on good terms now?"
    f "那，你俩这算是和好了？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1168
translate chinese freyapause_b9fa9695:

    # mc "I'm not really sure. She still has to prove herself to me through her actions."
    mc "我不太确定。她还是得通过行动向我证明自己。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1169
translate chinese freyapause_7ac35430:

    # f "And I guarantee that she will!"
    f "我保证她一定会的！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1170
translate chinese freyapause_2d5e5792:

    # f "You know? I was really shocked when you entered the room. I didn't know it was you!"
    f "你知道吗？你进来的时候把我吓了一跳。我怎么也想不到会是你！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1171
translate chinese freyapause_c5fbb805:

    # f "I'm really wondering how she ended up in your house, to be honest."
    f "现在我真的很想知道她怎么会住到你家来的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1172
translate chinese freyapause_2d30e2c3:

    # mc "Well, that's a long story..."
    mc "嗯，那就说来话长了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1173
translate chinese freyapause_390eddae:

    # yt "I guess it's alright to tell her, she's Aine's sister after all."
    yt "我觉得告诉她也没有关系，毕竟她是艾妮的妹妹。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1179
translate chinese freyapause_a83ba959:

    # "You tell Freya about Emma's plan..."
    "你把艾玛的计划告诉了芙蕾雅……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1187
translate chinese freyapause_0f0a9219:

    # f "I see... So that's why they're here, huh?"
    f "原来如此……她们是这样来的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1196
translate chinese freyapause_d293b8be:

    # mc "You seem pretty calm about it."
    mc "你怎么没什么反应呢。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1197
translate chinese freyapause_a9a14053:

    # f "I know Emma-chan. She will do everything for my sister's sake. Even if it costs her everything, so I'm not really surprised."
    f "我很了解艾玛酱。她为了我姐姐什么都愿意做，哪怕要付出她的一切。所以我倒没感觉很惊讶。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1198
translate chinese freyapause_306d619d:

    # f "She may have told you it's because she's Aine's servant, but that's not all. They're best friends, and they've really cared about each other since they were little."
    f "她或许跟你说过这都是因为她是艾妮的仆人，但不是那样的。她们是最好的朋友，从小时候开始就最在乎彼此。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1199
translate chinese freyapause_3ad123a1:

    # f "The only problem is that... Emma-chan is suppressing her emotions because of her sense of duty. *sighs*"
    f "唯一的问题是……艾玛酱因为责任感，总是压抑自己的情感。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1200
translate chinese freyapause_c4e34ff1:

    # yt "Now I know why Emma's personality is like that..."
    yt "那我算是知道为什么艾玛会是那种性格了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1209
translate chinese freyapause_f4047aaa:

    # f "They're both under mom's control and I really hate that fact!"
    f "她们都被妈妈掌控着，这点让我特别不爽！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1210
translate chinese freyapause_366c8332:

    # f "I will eventually fall under mom's control... Well, to be honest I already am. But I am not going to be like my sister! Not over my dead body!"
    f "我最终也会被妈妈操控……好吧，其实我现在已经被她掌控了。但我决不会轻易屈服！除非我死！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1211
translate chinese freyapause_0022638c:

    # f "I already had enough after seeing them both suffer! But, there's nothing that I could do for them."
    f "光是看到她们两个受苦就已经让我受够了！可是，我根本没有办法帮她们。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1212
translate chinese freyapause_604da89e:

    # f "Like my sister, I'm powerless against mom."
    f "就像姐姐一样，我也没法反抗妈妈。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1213
translate chinese freyapause_6a415a5e:

    # f "Now that they're here, it's only you who can help them. But I am not saying you have to."
    f "既然她们现在来到了这里，能帮上忙的就只有你了。但你并不是必须帮忙。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1214
translate chinese freyapause_15931992:

    # f "That is still up to you. They did something to you that you should have a grudge over, after all."
    f "一切还是要由你决定。毕竟，她们过去对你做的事不可原谅。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1215
translate chinese freyapause_4625f2a5:

    # f "Although, I'm guessing you already got over it since you're being kind to my sister and not tormenting them for what they did."
    f "不过，看到你对我姐姐这么和善，我想你已经不再恨她了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1224
translate chinese freyapause_821a384e:

    # f "And, I thank you for doing so... I only met you today, but I already know that you have a good heart."
    f "所以，我真的很感谢你可以放下过去……我今天才认识你，但我已经见识到你善良的内心了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1225
translate chinese freyapause_809d7c66:

    # f "Enough to forgive those who have sinned against you..."
    f "善良到愿意原谅那些对你施暴的人……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1226
translate chinese freyapause_62eff1ad:

    # mc "Are you really 19 years old? Because you're talking like a 30 year old in the body of kid right now."
    mc "你真的才19岁吗？你刚刚说的话起码是从一个30岁的人嘴里说出来的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1227
translate chinese freyapause_8680ff80:

    # f "Of course I am! But, I'm not the type of girl who's been pampered by her parents. I can even live on my own if they let me!"
    f "我可是如假包换的美少女！但是，我可不是那种被父母宠坏的小女生。只要他俩愿意，我完全可以自力更生！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1228
translate chinese freyapause_191d5de3:

    # f "I avoid relying on them as much as possible, so at this age, I already know things that other 19 year old girls out there don't."
    f "我不管做什么事都会尽量避免依靠父母，所以我懂很多其他19岁的女生不懂的东西。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1229
translate chinese freyapause_f7d3cdb3:

    # mc "That makes sense."
    mc "很有道理。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1230
translate chinese freyapause_d6635d17:

    # f "So... what's your plan, [mc!t]? Are you going to marry my sister? *giggles*"
    f "那……你要怎么办呢，[mc!t]？你要跟我姐姐结婚吗？ *笑*"

# game/ep2.rpy:1231
translate chinese freyapause_53388b5e:

    # mc "No, I won't. That will not solve anything, Freya. Even if I decided to do it, we can't say for sure that your mother will let her go for good."
    mc "我不会的。跟她结婚也什么都解决不了，芙蕾雅。即使我那么做了，你妈妈也不一定会就这么放她走。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1232
translate chinese freyapause_55c9f52f:

    # mc "And I'm thinking of Aine's side too."
    mc "我这也是为了艾妮着想。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1233
translate chinese freyapause_7c32e26e:

    # mc "Let's say that we both agree to it, and then what? Hide from her parents forever? For sure she doesn't want that."
    mc "假设我俩都同意了，然后呢？一辈子都要躲着她的父母？她肯定也不想那么做。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1234
translate chinese freyapause_d37c0ad0:

    # f "You have a point there..."
    f "你说的没错……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1235
translate chinese freyapause_a0966153:

    # mc "I'm not really sure yet, but I want to talk to your mother."
    mc "我还没真正决定，但我想跟你妈妈谈谈。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1244
translate chinese freyapause_46883b34:

    # f "Wait, what?! Talk to my mom? Are you for real?!"
    f "等等，你说啥？！去找我妈？你认真的吗？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1245
translate chinese freyapause_23325346:

    # f "You can't just do that, you know? How do you even plan to do that?"
    f "她可不会随便跟人说话，你知道吗？你知道你在说什么吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1246
translate chinese freyapause_61be1ee1:

    # f "Us, her daughters, can probably talk to her without any security and identity check. But you, I'm not really sure, [mc!t]. Also I couldn't take you in there just like that!"
    f "我俩是她的女儿，所以肯定可以随意去找她。但你就不一样了，[mc!t]。我可没办法直接带你去找她！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1247
translate chinese freyapause_f0d13e73:

    # mc "I'm not planning to do it anytime soon. But, I will definitely come up with a plan for it. I want to hear it from her own mouth."
    mc "我本来也没打算立马去找她。但，我之后一定会想出来一个办法的。我一定要听她亲口说出真相。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1248
translate chinese freyapause_e0eed675:

    # mc "For sure, Miss Jess can help me out with that. She knows you, so I'm thinking that she knows your family too."
    mc "我觉得婕斯小姐肯定可以帮我。她认识你，所以应该也认识你家其他的人。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1249
translate chinese freyapause_b94d4c78:

    # f "Yes, she knows my mom... but, are you really sure about that? Like a hundred percent sure?!"
    f "她确实认识我妈……但，你真的确定吗？百分之百确定？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1250
translate chinese freyapause_14266624:

    # mc "I've made up my mind. That's the only way for me to learn the truth."
    mc "我意已决。要想知道真相，只有这一个办法。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1251
translate chinese freyapause_70191b2e:

    # f "Well, alright then. I'll support you anyway I can if you really want to do it."
    f "好吧。假如你一定要做，那我也会想办法帮你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1252
translate chinese freyapause_716cda44:

    # mc "Thanks, Freya."
    mc "谢谢你，芙蕾雅。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1253
translate chinese freyapause_39ca7841:

    # f "Hey, no problemo~!"
    f "小事一桩哦~！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1254
translate chinese freyapause_2e3b9269:

    # mc "I'll set Aine properly on her bed, then I'll have to get Sky so we can prepare dinner."
    mc "我去把艾妮放到床上躺好，之后就去找斯凯，准备晚饭吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1255
translate chinese freyapause_524b05f4:

    # f "Sure!"
    f "好的！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1283
translate chinese ainepause2_0611f4ba:

    # "After eating dinner..."
    "吃过晚饭后……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1292
translate chinese ainepause2_741c7596:

    # yt "Okay, time to call Miss Jess. I just hope she's not busy right now..."
    yt "好了，给婕斯小姐打个电话吧。希望她现在不忙……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1295
translate chinese ainepause2_91047a3a:

    # ".........."
    "........."

# game/ep2.rpy:1298
translate chinese ainepause2_9c357e28:

    # j "Hey, [mc!t]! What's up? You, calling me at this time of the day... is there a problem?"
    j "嘿，[mc!t]！怎么了？你居然在这个时间给我打电话……出什么事了？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1299
translate chinese ainepause2_79501314:

    # mc "I'm sorry to call you so suddenly, Miss Jess. But, I have to ask you something."
    mc "抱歉突然打扰你，婕斯小姐。我想问你点事情。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1300
translate chinese ainepause2_01ab11fa:

    # j "Hm? Sure! Just ask away."
    j "嗯？好啊！你说吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1301
translate chinese ainepause2_9c68131f:

    # mc "You said that you and Freya know each other. And she told me that you know her mother too."
    mc "你之前跟我说你认识芙蕾雅，芙蕾雅又跟我说你还认识她妈妈。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1302
translate chinese ainepause2_b0d85501:

    # j "Oh, Hera? Yes, of course. We know each other. Why do you ask?"
    j "哦，你说赫拉吗？是的，我们认识。怎么了吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1303
translate chinese ainepause2_076c58e0:

    # mc "I told you a little bit about my past before when I applied for the job. I just learned something that can answer the questions that I have had in my head for some time now."
    mc "我之前来应聘的时候，也跟你说过一些我过去的事情。"
    mc "我现在有了能解答我一直想知道的问题的机会。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1304
translate chinese ainepause2_4dc11331:

    # mc "She's the only one who can answer those questions, so I'm planning to meet her. I figured that you might be able to help me with that, Miss Jess."
    mc "只有她才能解答那些问题，所以我想见她。我想请你帮我，婕斯小姐。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1307
translate chinese ainepause2_1c01cb9c:

    # j "Hold on, let me just park the car..."
    j "等等，我先去停车……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1315
translate chinese ainepause2_d412f818:

    # j "Hm... meeting Hera, huh? I'm not looking down on you, [mc!t]. But a normal person like you meeting Hera is like a beggar asking to meet the President!"
    j "嗯……你……想见赫拉？我真的不是看不起你，[mc!t]。但像你这样的平头百姓去见她，就好像是一个乞丐想见总统一样！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1316
translate chinese ainepause2_ce23e456:

    # j "Considering what you told me before as well, it's like you jumping from a plane without any parachute too!"
    j "再加上你之前告诉过我的事情，我还觉得你像是在玩没有降落伞的跳伞一样！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1317
translate chinese ainepause2_83f5ecfd:

    # mc "But... it's not totally impossible, right? And I know you can make it happen too, Miss Jess."
    mc "但……并不是完全不可能，对吧？我知道你可以帮我见她的，婕斯小姐。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1320
translate chinese ainepause2_eee42197:

    # j "Heh! I like your mindset, [mc!t]. You've impressed me with your guts once again."
    j "哈！我喜欢你这种心态，[mc!t]。你又一次用你的胆量打动了我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1321
translate chinese ainepause2_c2be14a3:

    # mc "If we're talking about power, then there's no one else I can ask but you."
    mc "既然涉及到权贵，那我能找的人只有你了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1322
translate chinese ainepause2_74529e7f:

    # j "You're really playing with fire here, [mc!t], you know that?"
    j "你知道你是在玩火吗，[mc!t]？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1323
translate chinese ainepause2_3e50a258:

    # mc "I know, Miss Jess. But, I have a gut feeling that there are more people involved in this. All I want is answers to settle the questions I have in my mind once and for all."
    mc "我知道，婕斯小姐。但我感觉发生在我身上的事牵连到很多人。我只想知道我脑海里所有问题的答案，这样我才能没有负担地生活下去，"

# game/ep2.rpy:1324
