    yt "而且，例行的卫生检查还没做呢，毕竟平常这事都是莉莉负责的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:264
translate chinese ep2_b91c160b:

    # mc "Whoa... That's quite something."
    mc "哇哦……这真算是了不起。"

# game/ep2.rpy:265
translate chinese ep2_532d393e:

    # mc "I can't believe a highschool student can make games."
    mc "没想到现在的高中生都可以做游戏了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:274
translate chinese ep2_a90cd506:

    # f "Hah! It's nothing, really."
    f "哈！没那么厉害的，真的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:275
translate chinese ep2_8d4e5150:

    # f "I am not allowed to do them, to be honest. So I'm keeping it a secret, at least from my mom."
    f "家里不让我干这种事，所以我都是偷偷做的，至少也要瞒着我妈。"

# game/ep2.rpy:276
translate chinese ep2_72ea8ae9:

    # f "I really hate her, so I don't want to rely on her financially."
    f "我特别讨厌她，所以她的钱我一分都不想要。"

# game/ep2.rpy:277
translate chinese ep2_4adbbdb8:

    # f "Fortunately, she allowed me to take a proper job even though it is temporary, so here I am."
    f "还好，她愿意让我暂时出来尝试一些正经工作。所以我才能来到这里。"

# game/ep2.rpy:279
translate chinese ep2_de9afd2a:

    # mc "Uhm... If you don't mind, can I ask how old are you?"
    mc "嗯……你不介意的话，我能问问你几岁了吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:280
translate chinese ep2_97c65a38:

    # f "Not a problem! I'm already 19 years old! Hehe~!"
    f "没事呀！我不介意的。我都已经19岁了！嘿嘿~！"

# game/ep2.rpy:281
translate chinese ep2_fdcc88c4:

    # yt "She's still young, and yet she's thinking like she's older than me."
    yt "她还很小，但想法却好像已经比我还成熟了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:282
translate chinese ep2_edd48554:

    # yt "If she's really Aine's sister, considering how her mom treats her, she'll probably end up like Aine someday."
    yt "如果她真的是艾妮的妹妹，就凭她俩的妈妈的作为，她迟早有一天会变得跟艾妮一样。"

# game/ep2.rpy:300
translate chinese ep2_168c421b:

    # f "I have been looking for her for days now."
    f "我已经找她找了好几天了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:301
translate chinese ep2_8cf8b9b5:

    # f "She wasn't in her previous apartment when I went there and I can't contact her through her phone number!"
    f "她从原来的住处搬走了，而且打电话也打不通！"

# game/ep2.rpy:302
translate chinese ep2_e3567313:

    # f "I... I already miss her so much! She's been away from home for years, and now, I can't even find her..."
    f "我……我特别想她！她离开家好几年了，更别说现在我连她人在哪都不知道……"

# game/ep2.rpy:306
translate chinese ep2_6108ee39:

    # yt "But, I think I should at least tell Freya sister where she is. I could probably get some clues about Aine this way too."
    yt "但，我觉得至少可以告诉她艾妮现在在哪。说不定我还能借此机会多了解一下艾妮……"

# game/ep2.rpy:308
translate chinese ep2_3a7d4416:

    # mc "Your sister is... actually living in our house."
    mc "你姐姐现在……其实就住在我家里。"

# game/ep2.rpy:311
translate chinese ep2_b547e196:

    # f "EXCUSE MEEE~?!!"
    f "你说啥~~~？！！"

# game/ep2.rpy:342
translate chinese ep2_0fdc8c85:

    # f "Miss Lily? Sure, no problem."
    f "莉莉姐姐吗？我当然没问题。"

# game/ep2.rpy:343
translate chinese ep2_4c20356a:

    # f "I will go and meet with my teacher too, so we could probably meet somewhere before going to your place."
    f "我下班之后也得去找一下我的老师，那我们在去你家之前先找个地方碰面吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:369
translate chinese ep2_a85d0945:

    # yt "Wait... this guy is back here again?!"
    yt "等等……这货怎么又来了？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:370
translate chinese ep2_71c409c2:

    # yt "Doesn't he have anything to do with his life but to try his luck in getting food for free?!"
    yt "他整天就靠四处碰瓷活着吗？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:378
translate chinese ep2_a4264c7a:

    # f "This place has the best burgers in the entire universe!"
    f "这个地方的汉堡全宇宙最好吃！"

# game/ep2.rpy:379
translate chinese ep2_b8863fe3:

    # f "There is no way in hell a dirty little pest such as yourself could get into our food!"
    f "哪他妈的可能会吃到你的蟑螂野爹！"

# game/ep2.rpy:380
translate chinese ep2_2323cd0b:

    # f "If you don't have any money to pay for your grub, then scram, you peasant!"
    f "要是没钱给你这狗嘴买屎吃就赶紧给老娘爬！你个龙鸣！"

# game/ep2.rpy:433
translate chinese freyapause_77adafbc:

    # f "I usually don't, but hey, that guy deserved it anyway. Plus, I know he's planning something."
    f "我平常不会这样，但那个人就是欠骂。再说了，我知道他肯定是不怀好意。"

# game/ep2.rpy:436
translate chinese freyapause_c8c1d7fe:

    # f "Yeah, I won't deny it. Ahaha!"
    f "确实，我也同意。啊哈哈！"

# game/ep2.rpy:438
translate chinese freyapause_f0658544:

    # f "At the end of the day, it still worked, so I make no promises."
    f "我的方法不管怎么说还是有用的，所以我没法保证。"

# game/ep2.rpy:466
translate chinese freyapause_c3477187:

    # l "[mc!t]?"
    l "[mc!t]？"

# game/ep2.rpy:467
translate chinese freyapause_a029710f:

    # l "Oh... hold on. I'll open the gate for you."
    l "哦……等一下。我给你开门。"

# game/ep2.rpy:478
translate chinese freyapause_5da58956:

    # l "Thanks for coming all the way here, [mc!t]. I really appreciate the concern."
    l "谢谢你过来看我，[mc!t]。谢谢你关心我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:480
translate chinese freyapause_1d3aa6c9:

    # l "Uhm... You already helped me with improving my service skill and now you're here paying me a visit."
    l "嗯……你之前帮我练习接客技巧，现在还过来看我……"

# game/ep2.rpy:481
translate chinese freyapause_373b9b43:

    # l "I'm afraid that I might just be a burden to you..."
    l "我怕我给你添了太多负担了……"

# game/ep2.rpy:482
translate chinese freyapause_1219b10a:

    # mc "Don't worry about it. It's not just because it's my responsibility. But, you're a friend too!"
    mc "哪儿的话……不用在意的，莉莉。不光是因为责任，更因为你是我的朋友呀！"

# game/ep2.rpy:483
translate chinese freyapause_ba33f2fc:

    # l "Haha! Alright, if you say so."
    l "哈哈！好吧，那就听你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:485
translate chinese freyapause_b8147ba1:

    # l "I live alone, so I don't really have any choice."
    l "我一个人住，也没有其他人来帮我呀。"

# game/ep2.rpy:494
translate chinese freyapause_9eeea8d9:

    # l "Not so much for lunch. I don't really have the appetite. I feel like the food won't go down to my stomach at all."
    l "午饭就吃了一小点。主要是没什么胃口。感觉不管什么东西都咽不下去。"

# game/ep2.rpy:497
translate chinese freyapause_49c6a825:

    # mc "That's alright, at least you still tried."
    mc "那也没关系，至少你还是吃了一点。"

# game/ep2.rpy:498
translate chinese freyapause_887b853e:

    # mc "Look, I brought you meds for fever, and fruits that you can eat."
    mc "给，我给你带了点治发烧的药，还有点开胃的水果。"

# game/ep2.rpy:499
translate chinese freyapause_621d38dd:

    # mc "I'll cook you dinner right now, which you can just heat up in the microwave later."
    mc "我现在给你做晚饭，之后你用微波炉热一下就能吃了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:509
translate chinese freyapause_e141b009:

    # j "Your fever isn't that bad, so I don't really have to worry about you."
    j "你烧得不算很严重，所以我应该也不用太担心你。"

# game/ep2.rpy:510
translate chinese freyapause_66464953:

    # j "And I know [mc!t] will come here to take care of you later too."
    j "而且我敢说[mc!t]之后也会过来照顾你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:512
translate chinese freyapause_3367798b:

    # j "I will call him right after I leave."
    j "我待会走之后就给他打个电话。"

# game/ep2.rpy:513
translate chinese freyapause_aa301969:

    # j "I won't tell him to come and visit you, but I know that he will come in his own free will."
    j "我不会说让他来看你，但我知道他肯定会自己来找你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:514
translate chinese freyapause_3b4d49d9:

    # j "I've known him for some time now, and I know that he'll definitely come here."
    j "我认识他挺久了，我知道他绝对会来的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:515
translate chinese freyapause_a053d1b0:

    # j "What's more, he reminds me of someone I know."
    j "因为他跟我认识的一个人很像。"

# game/ep2.rpy:517
translate chinese freyapause_104b5818:

    # j "Yes. They have different personalities, but the kindness in their hearts aren't that much different."
    j "是的。他们的性格很不一样，但心底的那份善良却很相似。"

# game/ep2.rpy:518
translate chinese freyapause_e5d605f3:

    # j "They both take care of someone they really care about."
    j "他们都很关心自己在乎的人。"

# game/ep2.rpy:519
translate chinese freyapause_a513f1bf:

    # j "And [mc!t] is a really soft-hearted guy, unlike my boyfriend."
    j "但跟我男朋友不一样，[mc!t]是个心肠很软的男人。"

# game/ep2.rpy:541
translate chinese freyapause_e61e2e6a:

    # yt "There you go... There should be enough food portions until tomorrow."
    yt "好了……做这么多应该够她今晚和明天吃了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:542
translate chinese freyapause_fa132cda:

    # yt "All she has to do is to heat it up in the microwave and it's ready for serving."
    yt "只要用微波炉热一下就能直接开饭了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:543
translate chinese freyapause_70093194:

    # yt "Let's go back to Lily."
    yt "回去找莉莉吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:568
translate chinese freyapause_cf1adef2:

    # mc "Yeah."
    mc "是啊。"

# game/ep2.rpy:569
translate chinese freyapause_2a7c3a43:

    # mc "So, I made four portions of food for you that will last for quite a while."
    mc "我做了四份，应该够你吃很久了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:570
translate chinese freyapause_4fd079fa:

    # mc "Just put them in the microwave and your good."
    mc "想吃的时候用微波炉热一下就好了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:572
translate chinese freyapause_a317e899:

    # l "I got it."
    l "我明白了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:574
translate chinese freyapause_2e05fd05:

    # mc "I won't stay long now, Lily. I should give you time to rest, it's already getting late. I still have to go home, myself."
    mc "那我就不久留了，莉莉。我得让你好好休息，天也快黑了，我得尽快回家。"

# game/ep2.rpy:583
translate chinese freyapause_89f54ac7:

    # yt "Well, I guess she's just appreciative of me doing things for her."
    yt "看来她对我做的事真的很感激。"

# game/ep2.rpy:591
translate chinese freyapause_11794049:

    # l "Oh... Uhm... Thanks! Haha..."
    l "哦…呃……谢谢！哈哈……"

# game/ep2.rpy:592
translate chinese freyapause_e4ef2cad:

    # mc "I'll go now, alright?"
    mc "那我就先走了，好吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:595
translate chinese freyapause_05f74498:

    # mc "I will. Goodbye for now, Lily. And be sure to rest properly."
    mc "我会的。再见了，莉莉。好好休息。"

# game/ep2.rpy:655
translate chinese freyapause_e4a09214:

    # f "Not too long! Probably for about five minutes. My mom called me too, so no worries!"
    f "一点也不久！我才等了不到五分钟。而且正好跟我妈打了个电话，没事的！"

# game/ep2.rpy:656
translate chinese freyapause_5a3e9f25:

    # mc "Yeah, I couldn't help but overhear a bit of your conversation, sorry."
    mc "嗯，我刚刚过来的路上不小心听到了几句。不好意思。"

# game/ep2.rpy:659
translate chinese freyapause_9a077452:

    # f "Of course! We haven't seen each other for a while. I'm sure that she misses me too!"
    f "当然！我们都很久没见了。她肯定也很想我！"

# game/ep2.rpy:663
translate chinese freyapause_72d0456b:

    # f "Thanks, [mc!t]~!"
    f "谢谢你，[mc!t]~！"

# game/ep2.rpy:664
translate chinese freyapause_b8c32589:

    # f "My first impression of you is really good. You're really a nice guy!"
    f "我对你的第一印象特别好。你真是个好男人！"

# game/ep2.rpy:665
translate chinese freyapause_a8371d5e:

    # f "At least, I can breathe, now that I know that my sister is in safe hands."
    f "至少我现在知道我姐姐在好人手里，所以可以放心了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:666
translate chinese freyapause_d9ba9f54:

    # yt "{b}Hands{/b}, huh? Jeez..."
    yt "{b}在我手里{/b}？天啊……"

# game/ep2.rpy:687
translate chinese freyapause_c6d0b573:

    # f "Yeah, they're very pleasant to look at!"
    f "白墙特别好看！"

# game/ep2.rpy:688
translate chinese freyapause_bbeb2b26:

    # f "Even though my room is full of anime posters and stuff like that, I still like seeing this kind of design."
    f "虽然我房间里贴的全是二次元海报，我还是很喜欢看见这种设计。"

# game/ep2.rpy:690
translate chinese freyapause_1275fbee:

    # mc "It just doesn't convince me."
    mc "反正怎么想都感觉特别奇怪。"

# game/ep2.rpy:691
translate chinese freyapause_b4d39d0e:

    # f "I can't blame you, and that's what most people think about me as well."
    f "也不怪你，大家基本都是这么想的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:692
translate chinese freyapause_484623f0:

    # f "Don't jump to conclusions though... I can still be a kid sometimes."
    f "但你也别急着下结论……我有时候还是挺像个小孩的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:699
translate chinese freyapause_4e8ef819:

    # s "Yep! I redecorated the kitchen too!"
    s "是的！我还把厨房也打扮了一下！"

# game/ep2.rpy:700
translate chinese freyapause_d9fc077c:

    # s "It's better to liven up the house since we have people living here besides us now."
    s "既然有别人住进来了，得让房子更有活力才行。"

# game/ep2.rpy:701
translate chinese freyapause_76f300c0:

    # mc "That's a good idea!"
    mc "好主意！"

# game/ep2.rpy:702
translate chinese freyapause_e50f5f67:

    # mc "But you should take it easy, Sky..."
    mc "但是你别太累到自己了，斯凯……"

# game/ep2.rpy:703
translate chinese freyapause_a6596ce7:

    # mc "You've been so busy with your work lately. Don't burn yourself out now!"
    mc "最近你工作那么忙。不要把自己累坏了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:706
translate chinese freyapause_9683e23a:

    # s "Don't worry, I got Aine and Gwen's help with it, so it did not take that much effort."
    s "没事的，艾妮和格温也来帮忙了，所以也不算很累。"

# game/ep2.rpy:733
translate chinese freyapause_ab1a0048:

    # f "...and... so much... curves..."
    f "而且……曲线也很……"

# game/ep2.rpy:736
translate chinese freyapause_78e72460:

    # f "*gasps*! Of course, an enemy!"
    f "*惊讶*！ 遇敌警报！！"

# game/ep2.rpy:739
translate chinese freyapause_9b67f4a7:

    # s "Huh? What do you mean 'an enemy'?"
    s "啊？什么遇敌警报？"

# game/ep2.rpy:743
translate chinese freyapause_b60af882:

    # s "Oh, I see what it is now..."
    s "哦，原来是这样……"

# game/ep2.rpy:744
translate chinese freyapause_d3702b41:

    # s "Sorry to tell you, but {b}the bigger, the better{/b}!"
    s "很遗憾地告诉你，小妹妹，{b}越大越好{/b}！"

# game/ep2.rpy:747
translate chinese freyapause_c9275914:

    # f "No, you're wrong! {b}Flat is justice{/b}!"
    f "不对！{b}平胸才是正义{/b}！"

# game/ep2.rpy:809
translate chinese freyapause_b86ef464:

    # f "That's alright. I'm Freya, Aine's little sister. Nice to meet you, Sky."
    f "没关系的。我叫芙蕾雅，是艾妮的妹妹。很高兴见到你，斯凯。"

# game/ep2.rpy:814
translate chinese freyapause_a9bb7e1e:

    # s "Sure, I'll go back to my room too."
    s "没问题。我也回房间了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:825
translate chinese freyapause_5ce09775:

    # mc "Mhm."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/ep2.rpy:827
translate chinese freyapause_3d801cae:

    # yt "...I really want to know what's happening with their family."
    yt "……我真的特别想知道她们家里到底发生了什么事。"

# game/ep2.rpy:835
translate chinese freyapause_2011bc26:

    # a "Ahh... Hold on! I'm coming!"
    a "啊……等一下！来了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:841
translate chinese freyapause_9c060159:

    # a "F-Freya?!"
    a "什……芙蕾雅？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:847
translate chinese freyapause_62880847:

    # f "*crying* Sis~!"
    f "*大哭* 姐姐~！"

# game/ep2.rpy:851
translate chinese freyapause_5acc28cf:

    # a "How did you know that I'm here?"
    a "你怎么知道我在这的？"

# game/ep2.rpy:854
translate chinese freyapause_875694b9:

    # mc "I brought her."
    mc "我带她来的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:855
translate chinese freyapause_8c2e8d01:

    # mc "She apprently knows my boss and begged her to fill in for my co-worker who's not feeling well."
    mc "她认识我的老板，然后今天来替一个请了病假的同事上班。"

# game/ep2.rpy:856
translate chinese freyapause_429d563a:

    # mc "She looks a lot like you, so I asked her and confirmed that you two are related."
    mc "她看起来很像你，我就问了一下，发现她居然是你妹妹。"

# game/ep2.rpy:857
translate chinese freyapause_9a8721b4:

    # mc "She's been looking for you, so I let her tag along. I hope that's okay."
    mc "她一直在找你，我就把她带来了。希望你不会介意。"

# game/ep2.rpy:860
translate chinese freyapause_a655ab43:

    # a "No, I should thank you. We haven't seen each other for quite a while now."
    a "没事，我该谢谢你才对。我俩很久没见了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:861
translate chinese freyapause_7e39545b:

    # a "I had to temporarily cut off my connection to my mother."
    a "我之前把跟我妈之间的联系全都切断了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:878
translate chinese freyapause_a9099b0a:

    # yt "It's rude to eaves-drop with someone else's conversation, but... I can't help it."
    yt "偷听别人说话真的非常恶劣，但……我忍不住。"

# game/ep2.rpy:881
translate chinese freyapause_ce501a4a:

    # f "When will you come back home sis? It's getting really lonely there!"
    f "姐姐姐姐，你什么时候回家呀？我在家里特别孤独！"

# game/ep2.rpy:882
translate chinese freyapause_a35a7fd9:

    # a "I told you that I can't, right?"
    a "姐姐跟你说过，我没法回去，对吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:883
translate chinese freyapause_ca0dc6b0:

    # a "I can't let myself be mother's puppet anymore, Freya. What she did to me back then was more than enough."
    a "我再也不想当妈妈的傀儡了，芙蕾雅。她以前对我做的事实在太过分了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:884
translate chinese freyapause_fde812e1:

    # yt "Her mother is mistreating her?"
    yt "她的母亲……虐待她？"

# game/ep2.rpy:885
translate chinese freyapause_f0a44f6c:

    # yt "Emma mentioned that she doesn't have any freedom, but... why is she out here like it's nothing, then?"
    yt "艾玛也说过，艾妮一点自由都没有，但是……为什么她完全表现得跟没事人一样呢？"

# game/ep2.rpy:886
translate chinese freyapause_c2015b62:

    # yt "The same goes to Freya."
    yt "芙蕾雅也是一样。"

# game/ep2.rpy:894
translate chinese freyapause_0b339af4:

    # f "I don't watch the news, so... don't blame me."
    f "我从来不看新闻，所以……不怪我啊。"

# game/ep2.rpy:899
translate chinese freyapause_e65bc286:

    # f "WHAT?! That guy is like more than 50 years old!"
    f "什么？！那货看着都有50岁了吧！"

# game/ep2.rpy:900
translate chinese freyapause_9c36c001:

    # f "How can she plan to marry you with that old fag?! I don't get it!"
    f "妈妈怎么让你跟那种老逼登结婚啊？！我真是搞不懂！！"

# game/ep2.rpy:901
translate chinese freyapause_a05525a0:

    # yt "50 year old?! Jesus Christ!"
    yt "50岁？！我的天啊！"

# game/ep2.rpy:902
translate chinese freyapause_5c208801:

    # a "I'm against it, Freya. That is why I cut my connection to her, including you."
    a "我死也不可能同意的，芙蕾雅。所以我才跟家里，包括你，断绝了一切联系。"

# game/ep2.rpy:903
translate chinese freyapause_5afaee9f:

    # a "I know she can just get my phone number from you and track me that way."
    a "我知道她能从你那里搞到我的号码然后追踪我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:904
translate chinese freyapause_4cef7b7d:

    # f "...Then, what's your plan?"
    f "……那，你打算怎么办？"

# game/ep2.rpy:905
translate chinese freyapause_81b587c9:

    # f "That guy is nasty, rude and cocky as fuck! I won't let you marry that motherfucker!"
    f "那个人又恶心，又没礼貌，又爱瞎鸡巴吹牛！我不可能同意让你嫁给那个傻逼的！"

# game/ep2.rpy:907
translate chinese freyapause_31f4b247:

    # f "I can't help it! He may have a deep pocket, but he's the worst guy you could marry!"
    f "我忍不住啊！他是有钱，但绝对不可能配得上你！"

# game/ep2.rpy:909
translate chinese freyapause_ec6dbf53:

    # f "Alright, alright, I'm sorry..."
    f "好吧，好吧，对不起……"

# game/ep2.rpy:912
translate chinese freyapause_c8e61c6e:

    # f "Then why don't you find someone you could marry instead? Like [mc!t] for example!"
    f "那你干嘛不找个合适的人结婚？比如[mc!t]就可以！"

# game/ep2.rpy:913
translate chinese freyapause_a25b3dc1:

    # f "I can't vouch for him, but he seems to be a nice gentleman. Hahaha!"
    f "虽然我也不敢把话说死啦，但他看着还挺靠谱的。哈哈哈！"

# game/ep2.rpy:914
translate chinese freyapause_83e12354:

    # yt "Pardon?"
    yt "什么玩意儿？"

# game/ep2.rpy:916
translate chinese freyapause_71ca3296:

    # a "Where did that come from?! Marrying someone else will not solve my problem!"
    a "你怎么突然说这个？！跟别人结婚也解决不了我的问题！"

# game/ep2.rpy:917
translate chinese freyapause_65bb4b66:

    # a "Why... would I..."
    a "为什么……我要跟他……"

# game/ep2.rpy:934
translate chinese freyapause_1f1e5c4f:

    # f "Why is your face like a tomato, hmm?"
    f "你怎么脸比番茄还要红呀，嗯？"

# game/ep2.rpy:935
translate chinese freyapause_e6fbf83a:

    # f "Heeeh~"
    f "嘿嘿~"

# game/ep2.rpy:936
translate chinese freyapause_b8ef9e9d:

    # f "I get it, now. Something already happened between you two, am I right?"
    f "我懂了。你俩之间已经有点什么了，对吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:937
translate chinese freyapause_98928d3a:

    # f "Tell me, tell me! Did you guys already kiss?"
    f "快说快说！你们不会已经亲嘴了吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:938
translate chinese freyapause_24393947:

    # f "He told me you guys are not together, so why you are acting like this?"
    f "他跟我说你们俩没在谈恋爱，那你为啥还是这种反应呢？"

# game/ep2.rpy:939
translate chinese freyapause_f5f2bb57:

    # f "Something must have happened!"
    f "肯定有什么事！"

# game/ep2.rpy:941
translate chinese freyapause_c52143d9:

    # f "Then tell me! *giggles*"
    f "那你倒是跟我说说到底是哪样？ *笑*"

# game/ep2.rpy:953
translate chinese freyapause_aac7e12a:

    # f "Do you like him?"
    f "你喜欢他吗？"

# game/ep2.rpy:956
translate chinese freyapause_7faf7284:

    # a "No, I don't! Our previous interactions are just embarrassing!"
    a "什么呀，我不喜欢他！只是我们之前那几次都太尴尬了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:971
translate chinese freyapause_1c3f54d6:

    # a "Even if you tell me that, it won't change the fact that I hurt somebody back then. I'm still responsible for my own actions."
    a "即使你这么说，也改变不了我过去伤害了那个人的事实。我得为我自己的行为负责。"

# game/ep2.rpy:974
translate chinese freyapause_e7dd4b27:

    # a "I know it's not enough, but I still want to apologize for the things that I did to him."
    a "虽然道歉远远不够，但我还是想当面向他表示歉意。"

# game/ep2.rpy:975
translate chinese freyapause_98c8fcbd:

    # a "I'm ready to face all the consequences just to fix everything with him..."
    a "只要能让他好受点，我可以承担一切后果……"

# game/ep2.rpy:980
translate chinese freyapause_9f1e4b95:

    # yt "Ugh! Enough of this spying shit!"
    yt "操！去他的吧！我也不在这里藏着了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:986
translate chinese freyapause_fbbb9fb0:

    # mc "...Tell me why did you make my highschool a hell on earth."
    mc "……告诉我为什么你让我的高中生活每天都生不如死。"

# game/ep2.rpy:993
translate chinese freyapause_67ffffa5:

    # f "Uhm...... Uhh......"
    f "啊……这……"

# game/ep2.rpy:994
translate chinese freyapause_712dd282:

    # f "I think... I should leave you guys for now."
    f "那我……就不打扰你们两个了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1005
translate chinese freyapause_137e0940:

    # mc "Oh, right. You already {b}forgot{/b} about me."
    mc "哦，对了。原来你都已经把我给{b}忘了{/b}啊。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1009
translate chinese freyapause_def51f15:

    # mc "My name is [mc!t]. I'm the one you {b}bullied{/b} back in highschool. Nice to meet you again, Aine."
    mc "我的名字是[mc!t]。我就是那个你在高中{b}霸凌{/b}过的人。很高兴我们又见面了，艾妮。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1015
translate chinese freyapause_2848415d:

    # a "Y...you're..."
    a "你……你就是……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1019
translate chinese freyapause_e24a7c4b:

    # a "*hugs*"
    a "*抱住*"

# game/ep2.rpy:1027
translate chinese freyapause_5b777993:

    # a "I'm ready for whatever judgment and consequences you have for me. But at least... let's just stay like this for a while."
    a "不管你接下来要怎么对我，给我什么惩罚，我都做好了准备。但至少……就先让我抱紧你这一小段时间吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1030
translate chinese freyapause_4b127d36:

    # mc "You deserve to be, but no, I don't want to get my hands dirty just for that, Aine. I'm not that kind of person."
    mc "你当然活该受到惩罚，但是，我不想就因为那种事脏了我的手，艾妮。我不是那样的人。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1031
translate chinese freyapause_57a825d6:

    # mc "Right now, all I need is at least an explanation."
    mc "现在，我需要的只是解释而已。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1048
translate chinese freyapause_612f2d63:

    # a "I was wondering why I feel so comfortable everytime you do that to me."
    a "我一直都在想，为什么你摸我的头的时候，我总会感觉很安心。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1051
translate chinese freyapause_9845e3ab:

    # a "I see... But why? Why did you do that despite what I was doing to you?"
    a "原来如此……可是为什么？我那样对你，为什么你还要关心我？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1053
translate chinese freyapause_41fd0f69:

    # mc "That is something that I don't get myself."
    mc "连我自己也不知道为什么。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1054
translate chinese freyapause_c6cb4702:

    # mc "You did all those things to me. But, I was an idiot for not fighting back, and letting my feelings overtake my anger."
    mc "你对我做了那么多过分的事。但是，我太傻了，根本没有反击。甚至还让我对你的喜欢压过了我的愤怒。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1055
translate chinese freyapause_de9ddd75:

    # mc "I was so stupid and naive."
    mc "我那时候太傻，太天真了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1056
translate chinese freyapause_a695357c:

    # mc "I know I should've tormented you for what you did. I even pushed to change myself for that reason."
    mc "我本来觉得我一定也要让你受折磨。我甚至还为此去大幅地改变自己。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1057
translate chinese freyapause_de1a0be3:

    # mc "But, as I got older and have more control over decisions, I realized that any time I spent getting back at you would just be a waste..."
    mc "但是，我长大、成熟之后，开始重新思考自己做过的各种决定。我认为，花时间报复你根本一点都不值……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1058
translate chinese freyapause_f27d2047:

    # mc "...And so I focused on my own life instead."
    mc "……所以我就认真过好自己的生活。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1059
translate chinese freyapause_0120bb04:

    # mc "I already threw everything away, Aine... That includes my feelings for you."
    mc "我已经放下了过去的一切，艾妮……也包括那时候我对你的感情。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1060
translate chinese freyapause_4a350832:

    # a "{i}He... really is a good guy... I feel... so terrible.{/i}"
    a "{i}他……真是个好人……我现在……实在太羞愧了。{/i}"

# game/ep2.rpy:1080
translate chinese freyapause_66619066:

    # a "Alright, I'll get straight to the point, then. There's no reason to lie and hide it now..."
    a "好吧，那我就从那里开始讲吧。我现在也没有理由骗你或者瞒着你……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1082
translate chinese freyapause_3947b6be:

    # a "...Mom was controlling me to do those horrible things to you."
    a "……是我妈命令我那么对你的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1085
translate chinese freyapause_9c186c41:

    # a "It didn't have anything to do with you confessing to me before."
    a "而且也完全不是因为你向我表白。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1086
translate chinese freyapause_e37f135d:

    # a "Even if you hadn't, she still would have pushed me to do it."
    a "即使你没有，她也会逼着我欺负你。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1087
translate chinese freyapause_1012e769:

    # mc "My... god! Just... what kind of family do you have, Aine?!"
    mc "我的……天啊！你的家里人都是些什么神经病啊，艾妮？！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1088
translate chinese freyapause_770f3919:

    # mc "But I can't understand..."
    mc "但是我不明白……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1093
translate chinese freyapause_4c43aa84:

    # a "But even though I was forced, I know that what I did was still wrong."
    a "但即使我是被强迫的，我也知道我做的事是错的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1094
translate chinese freyapause_0d3c4367:

    # a "And there's nothing that I can do to absolve myself and reverse all the bad things that I did."
    a "我不管做什么都没法为我自己开脱，没法补救我对你造成的伤害。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1095
translate chinese freyapause_90f526d2:

    # a "So, I won't ask for your forgiveness."
    a "所以我不会请求你的原谅。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1096
translate chinese freyapause_b2999fee:

    # a "It's too selfish of me to ask, but all I want is your understanding."
    a "那样就太自私了。我只想让你理解我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1116
translate chinese freyapause_a84d50a6:

    # yt "My blood is boiling just listening to her right now!"
    yt "光听她说这些，我浑身的血液都气得要沸腾了！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1117
translate chinese freyapause_cff0d943:

    # yt "They're supposed to treat each other well! That's what family is supposed to be!"
    yt "一家人本来要互相照顾，和睦共处才对！这才是亲人存在的意义！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1118
translate chinese freyapause_b842d11f:

    # yt "I want to do something to uncover all this. I have a feeling that this isn't just between me and Aine."
    yt "我想做点什么来找出所有的真相。我有预感，这一切绝对不是只跟我和艾妮有关的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1121
translate chinese freyapause_3de8dfc8:

    # yt ".........."
    yt "………………"

# game/ep2.rpy:1125
translate chinese freyapause_d564c27a:

    # yt "Maybe Miss Jess would be able to help me. She might know the family too..."
    yt "或许婕斯小姐能帮我。她可能也认识这个家族里的其他人……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1126
translate chinese freyapause_9eefa5e3:

    # yt "But I can't be sure just yet. Maybe I can try and contact her later."
    yt "但我还不能确定。之后我可以问问她。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1127
translate chinese freyapause_f8c56d06:

    # yt "So much for leads and clues, huh?"
    yt "这件事就先想到这里吧。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1128
translate chinese freyapause_5929d3c1:

    # yt "now, it led me to another mystery..."
    yt "还有别的谜团……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1129
translate chinese freyapause_e975a6c8:

    # mc "I have a question..."
    mc "我有一个问题……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1130
translate chinese freyapause_54f6cade:

    # mc "How did you manage to move out of your house if that's the case?"
    mc "既然这样的话，你是怎么从家里跑出来的？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1141
translate chinese freyapause_2eb248f7:

    # yt "No, that's too shallow considering what her family is like. There's gonna be something behind it."
    yt "不，如果她家里真是像她说的那样的话，这个原因实在站不住脚。背后肯定还隐藏着其他的原因。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1142
translate chinese freyapause_7ecb1e22:

    # a "I was so happy thinking that I would finally have my freedom, but I was wrong."
    a "我本来以为这样一来我终于就自由了，但我却大错特错了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1143
translate chinese freyapause_83a56dcb:

    # a "Even though I'm outside, I still don't have much freedom."
    a "即使离开了家，我依然没有自由可言。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1144
translate chinese freyapause_16da0c1a:

    # a "Now, she even set me up to marry her business partner."
    a "现在，她甚至还准备让我嫁给她的生意伙伴。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1153
translate chinese freyapause_34ba2b17:

    # a "I feel like a shameless little bitch facing you right now because of what I did..."
    a "再看看我做过的那些事……在你面前，我感觉我自己就像一个无耻的贱婊子一样……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1155
translate chinese freyapause_834f45eb:

    # a "I'm sorry, but I have been holding back my feelings. I want to cry my heart out, I want to scream out all the pent-up feelings inside me."
    a "对不起，只是我一直在压抑我自己的情绪。我想大哭一场，我想大喊大叫，把我脑子里的东西全都释放出来。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1156
translate chinese freyapause_e7aafa30:

    # a "But... I can't."
    a "但是……我做不到。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1161
translate chinese freyapause_3b21f354_1:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1166
translate chinese freyapause_6f942e8a:

    # mc "It's okay to cry."
    mc "都哭出来吧，没事的。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1167
translate chinese freyapause_a70b16f9:

    # mc "At least... that's what you can do right now. Don't worry about anything for now, and just cry it out."
    mc "至少……那是你现在能做到的一切了。不用在意其他的事了，都哭出来就好了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1204
translate chinese freyapause_fcd05d64:

    # yt "...I even forgot to ask some of the questions I have for her... But, that can wait."
    yt "……我甚至都忘了把我想的问题问完……但是，倒也不急。之后再问就是了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1212
translate chinese freyapause_73ed3a44:

    # mc "Where did you go?"
    mc "你刚刚去哪了？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1220
translate chinese freyapause_c21b5dbd:

    # mc "I'm not too sure about that."
    mc "我也说不上来。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1221
translate chinese freyapause_2b24dc8a:

    # f "I can guarantee that she will do something about it, trust me."
    f "我可以保证她之后一定会通过行动证明她自己的，相信我。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1222
translate chinese freyapause_9a0cbe4f:

    # f "But, you know? I was really shocked when you entered the room. I didn't know it was you!"
    f "我跟你说啊，你进来的时候把我吓了一跳。我怎么也想不到会是你！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1248
translate chinese freyapause_52edd7b4:

    # mc "You seem pretty nonchalant about it."
    mc "你怎么没什么反应呢。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1250
translate chinese freyapause_04e96a86:

    # f "She may be Aine's servant, but that's not all there is to it."
    f "虽然她是艾妮的仆人，但这不是全部的原因。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1251
translate chinese freyapause_ef8bc093:

    # f "They're best friends, and they've really cared about each other since they were little."
    f "她们是最好的朋友，从小时候开始就最在乎彼此。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1261
translate chinese freyapause_e6090071:

    # f "I, myself will eventually fall under mom's control..."
    f "我自己最终也会被妈妈操控……"

# game/ep2.rpy:1262
translate chinese freyapause_7a05d10f:

    # f "Well, to be honest I already am. But I am not going to be like my sister! Not over my dead body!"
    f "好吧，其实我现在已经被她掌控了。但我绝对不要跟姐姐一样！除非我死！"

# game/ep2.rpy:1265
translate chinese freyapause_8fd16afc:

    # f "Now that they're here, it might be just you who can help them."
    f "既然她们现在来到了这里，能帮她们的估计就是你了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1266
translate chinese freyapause_07b5ddb8:

    # f "But I am not saying you have to."
    f "但我并不是说你必须帮忙。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1267
translate chinese freyapause_dcd16a95:

    # f "That is still up to you."
    f "还是要由你自己决定。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1268
translate chinese freyapause_72a4c633:

    # f "They did something to you that you should have a grudge over, after all."
    f "毕竟，她们过去对你做的那些事，你有怨气也正常。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1269
translate chinese freyapause_d7061a1f:

    # f "Although, I'm guessing you already got over it, no?"
    f "不过，我猜你已经不在乎那些了，对吧？"

# game/ep2.rpy:1270
translate chinese freyapause_5ce09775_1:

    # mc "Mhm."
    mc "嗯。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1279
translate chinese freyapause_916c6fe6:

    # f "I only met you today, but I already know that you have a good heart."
    f "我今天才认识你，但我已经见识到你善良的内心了。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1281
translate chinese freyapause_b8e77648:

    # mc "Are you really 19 years old? Because I feel like you are way older than that."
    mc "你真的才19岁吗？我感觉你比那个年龄要成熟得多。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1282
translate chinese freyapause_830b8cfd:

    # f "Of course I am! But, I'm not the type of girl who's been pampered by her parents. I can even live on my own if they would let me!"
    f "我当然19岁啊！但是，我可不是那种被父母宠坏的小女生。只要家里愿意，我完全可以自力更生！"

