    # f "I avoid relying on them as much as possible, so at this age, I already know things that other 19 year old brats out there don't."
    f "我不管做什么事都会尽量避免依靠父母，所以我懂很多其他19岁的女生不懂的东西。"

# game/ep2.rpy:1285
translate chinese freyapause_8f5743f9:

    # f "So... what's your plan, [mc!t]? Are you going to marry my sister? Ahaha!"
    f "那……你要怎么办呢，[mc!t]？你要跟我姐姐结婚吗？啊哈哈！"

